18.8 Revenue Management and Governance
Interlink must implement the following controls:
All financial transactions must have unique references.
Payment confirmation must be verified server-side.
Every commission must be calculated using the applicable rate at the time of booking.
Completed, refunded, and disputed transactions must be separately identifiable.
Financial records must not be silently deleted.
Administrative adjustments must require authorised permissions and audit logging.
Payment records must reconcile with payment provider records.
Mentor payout information must remain confidential.
Subscription renewals and cancellations must be clearly communicated.
Financial reports must distinguish gross transaction value from actual platform revenue.

