21.1 Payment and Transaction Management
Feature Description
A secure payment management module allowing mentees to pay for mentorship sessions and Interlink to calculate commissions and manage mentor earnings.
Business Objective
Enable transaction-based monetisation and provide a reliable financial infrastructure.
User Story
As a mentee, I want to pay for a mentorship session securely so that I can confirm my booking.
